                    <a class="spotlight-story" href="https://www.mchenry.edu/news/2026/10/u-center-NIU-nursing.html">
                                                                <div class="spotlight-image">
									<img alt="An MCC nursing student in purple scrubs checks a patient's abdomen in a hospital bed, while another nurse observes in a clinical lab.." src="https://www.mchenry.edu/news/_files/images/banner/Nursing-Lab-2025-21-1.jpg"/>
								</div>
								<div class="spotlight-content">
                            <h3><span>MCC and NIU Partner to Launch New RN to BSN Pathway</span></h3>
                            <p>            MCC graduates and local nurses can now earn a flexible, fully online Bachelor of Science in Nursing from NIU through the University Center.
    </p>
                        </div>
